Package: osaSS3
Type: Package
Title: Experimental OSA Residual Reweighting for Stock Synthesis 3
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("OSA", "Working Group", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Iteratively updates Stock Synthesis 3 multinomial length and age
    composition variance adjustment factors using one-step-ahead residual
    standard deviations. Provides stratum-specific composite diagnostic PDFs.
    This is an experimental research heuristic, not a validated estimator.
